  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Shrine — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At last at 18th level, you have reached the pinnacle of your innate technique, letting you finally expand your domain. <br />\nAt initiative 20, the domain cuts everything, causing targets to suffer the effects of <em>Cleave</em> and <em>Dismantle</em>. <em>Cleave</em> targets creatures within cursed energy and <em>Dismantle</em> targets anything in the domain including objects. <em>Cleave</em> and <em>Dismantle</em> are treated as if the maximum amount of Cursed Energy was used.</p>",
